OL,3,GNEWSAPair jailed for murdering
OL,4,Avulnerable step-brother
OL,5,
OL,6,FA couple who inflicted "deliberate
OL,7,Fcruelty" on a vulnerable man in their
OL,8,Fcare have been jailed for life for his
OL,9,Fmurder.
OL,11,FRubin Blount, who weighed just 40kg
OL,12,F(six stone) at the time of his death in
OL,13,FNovember 2022, had been forced to stand
OL,14,Ffor long periods of time and eat out of
OL,15,Fbins at the address he lived at in
OL,16,FTamworth, Staffordshire.
OL,18,FStepbrother Kenneth Newton, 58, and his
OL,19,Fpartner Melanie James, 64, both from
OL,20,FBirmingham, filmed themselves mocking
OL,21,Fand abusing the 28-year-old.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
